CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: are relevant sa kanyang particular

1406
01:45:39,840 --> 01:45:41,900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na mandato. So kung magawa

1407
01:45:41,900 --> 01:45:43,580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: nila ito sa bawat ahensya,

1408
01:45:43,880 --> 01:45:46,060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: which is a mandate of the Joint Circular,

1409
01:45:46,700 --> 01:45:47,940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: DBM, lahat

1410
01:45:47,940 --> 01:45:49,740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ng national agencies,

1411
01:45:49,900 --> 01:45:51,680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: the LGUs are under the supervision

1412
01:45:51,680 --> 01:45:53,380
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: of the Executive Department.

1413
01:45:53,760 --> 01:45:55,660
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So if this can be strictly

1414
01:45:55,660 --> 01:45:57,600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: implemented, the data that

1415
01:45:57,600 --> 01:45:59,760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: we need to create

1416
01:45:59,760 --> 01:46:01,720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: craft policies appropriate

