01:59:45,180 --> 01:59:47,500
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: 2025, the President

1812
01:59:47,500 --> 01:59:49,460
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: asked CSC

1813
01:59:49,460 --> 01:59:51,340
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: to involve itself in the

1814
01:59:51,340 --> 01:59:53,620
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: creation of the JMC. So, napasama

1815
01:59:53,620 --> 01:59:55,380
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kami. So, hindi na siguro accurate

1816
01:59:55,380 --> 01:59:57,260
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: na sabihin completely wala kaming

1817
01:59:57,260 --> 01:59:59,320
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: pakialam sa COSCOs.

1818
02:00:00,000 --> 02:00:24,500
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ang pakialam namin is to work with DBM and COA. Ang first output ng aming naging trabaho ay yung formulation ng JMC. At ang concrete result noon, Madam Chair, is that yung na-site kanina na yung mga auxiliary benefits tulad ng solo parent na ang tagal nang pinaglalaban ni Congressman Nazal,

1819
02:00:24,500 --> 02:00:41,800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: eh on the part of the CSC, we interpret 11.2 of the JMC provision as giving the benefit to the JOCOS to be entitled to the Solo Parent Leave Act. Pero CSC lang po ito. Bahala si DBM at COA kung anong positioning nila on the matter.

1820
02:00:41,800 --> 02:00:57,340
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: But with respect to CSC, nag-usap kami, ganun yung interpretation po namin na covered ang JOCOS doon sa provision of law granting solo parent leave sa mga tatay yata yung nakalagay doon na 7 days.

1821
02:00:57,780 --> 02:01:11,240
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Pero yun nga po, I think maraming lalakbayin to refine the mechanism para may tatakbuhan na tulad ng sinabi ni Congressman Eli kanina, may ready na pwedeng takbuhan.

1822
02:01:11,240 --> 02:01:29,340
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ang mga JOCOS to air out their grievances kung anong may mga reklamo sila. But the nature of the contract, Madam Chair, is that yun yung principally nag-govern sa relationship ng JOCOS at ng agency na pinaglilingkuran nila.

1823
02:01:29,340 --> 02:01:39,340
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So on the part of the COA, DBM, and CSC, I think we can come up with a mechanism na pwedeng doon i-air yung...

1824
02:01:39,340 --> 02:01:50,080
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kung may problema, whether yung kontrata ni JO at COS is violative of the JMC or hindi sinunod ng particular agency yung kontrata ang pinirmaan niya.

1825
02:01:52,360 --> 02:02:00,140
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Commissioner, let me make it clear. Answerable by yes or no? So ngayon, base sa sagot mo, may pakialam na ang civil service?

1826
02:02:00,240 --> 02:02:07,920
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: I think because of our involvement in the JMC, Madam Chair, may pakialam talaga yung CSC na sa mga JOCOS.

1827
02:02:07,920 --> 02:02:08,920
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Thank you for the affirmation.

1828
02:02:09,340 --> 02:02:15,960
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: It's an exclusive answer. Kanina, puro na kayo kay Congressman Elijah at saka kay Congressman Nasale. Anyways, thank you.

1829
02:02:16,100 --> 02:02:19,720
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Not exclusive jurisdiction, Kong, kasi isa lang kami sa tatlo.

1830
02:02:19,820 --> 02:02:20,340
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Yes, I know.

1831
02:02:21,420 --> 02:02:29,680
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: May pakialam. Iba kasi po, yung technical po kasi yung jurisdiction. Ang jurisdiction is kaya mo nang i-rule yung mga bagay-bagay, anything that governs the...

1832
02:02:29,680 --> 02:02:31,880
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Commissioner, tumatakbo yung aking oras. Sige ka.

1833
02:02:33,560 --> 02:02:34,040
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Sige.

1834
02:02:34,360 --> 02:02:34,560
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Okay.

1835
02:02:34,960 --> 02:02:35,440
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Okay, go.

1836
02:02:35,440 --> 02:02:38,880
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ang jurisdiction po is ability mo as a body to govern.

1837
02:02:39,340 --> 02:02:51,600
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: To issue rules governing that particular class of people. Wala po yun talaga. Pero dahil sa tatlong involvement namin sa JMC, to that extent, meron po kaming pakialam.

1838
02:02:51,760 --> 02:03:04,760
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Pero hindi siya necessarily jurisdiction. To cite an example, yung Solo Parent Act, for example, na covering proposed or argued to cover JOs at COs,

1839
02:03:04,760 --> 02:03:08,320
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: ang may jurisdiction po yun. Kung pag-uusapan natin ang jurisdiction,

1840
02:03:09,340 --> 02:03:19,660
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kasi ng subject matter na yun ay DSWD. So kung usapan ng jurisdiction on Solo Parent Act as applied to JOs and COs, yung DSWD po ang implementing agency for that.

1841
02:03:20,460 --> 02:03:21,880
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Maraming salamat, Commissioner.

1842
02:03:22,500 --> 02:03:31,500
