02:10:45,210 --> 02:10:45,570
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Yes.

1920
02:10:46,170 --> 02:10:50,130
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Sasagutin ko, binigyan mo ako ng chance makapagtanong po ulit ng isa pa.

