1930
02:11:05,270 --> 02:11:11,850
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, nais kong magtanong tungkol sa implementation ng Anti-Sexual Harassment Act at ng Bawal Bastos Law.

1931
02:11:13,270 --> 02:11:25,790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat po ba ng NGAs, LGUs, SUCs, LUCs, GOCCs na may charter ay may funksyonal na Committee on Decorum and Investigation?

1932
02:11:26,730 --> 02:11:28,230
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, pasan niyo po sa akin.

1933
02:11:32,680 --> 02:11:41,580
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Yes, Madam Chair, the answer po is in the affirmative because that is a requirement of the law and the rules issued by the Civil Service Commission po.

1934
02:11:43,140 --> 02:11:46,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ilalim, Madam Chair, ng Bawal Bastos Law, Section 20.

1935
02:11:46,660 --> 02:11:47,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Routine inspection.

1936
02:11:48,360 --> 02:11:54,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang CSC ay naatasan na magsagawa ng yearly spontaneous inspections.

1937
02:11:54,760 --> 02:11:58,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dito po bang nakaraang taon nakagawa tayo ng mga inspection?

1938
02:11:58,640 --> 02:12:00,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan sa mga NGAs?

1939
02:12:00,180 --> 02:12:01,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat po ba ito?

1940
02:12:01,540 --> 02:12:16,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kada grupo ay meron po tayong nakuhang sample na sapat para matiyak natin yung functional compliance ng mga agencies na ito sa pagpapatupad ng mahalagang batas.

1941
02:12:17,340 --> 02:12:29,320
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, our regional offices are actually doing regular inspection of the existence of the different HR mechanisms in the different agencies under their jurisdiction.

1942
02:12:29,580 --> 02:12:36,360
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: However, with respect to the presence of the CODI, sa ngayon po, wala po sa amin yung data.

1943
02:12:36,500 --> 02:12:45,680
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: If your honor will allow, we will request our regional offices to gather the data and submit to your office.

1944
02:12:45,680 --> 02:12:48,140
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: The report immediately as soon as we get them.

1945
02:12:50,430 --> 02:12:57,050
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na pondo para dito ay kinukuha mula sa gender and development allocation?

1946
02:12:57,290 --> 02:13:00,630
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O Mary, may specific po kayo na item for this?

1947
02:13:01,650 --> 02:13:02,350
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Ah, teka lang po.

1948
02:13:08,330 --> 02:13:11,210
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yan, naka-attribute po sa GAD, GAD budget.

1949
02:13:11,690 --> 02:13:14,770
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero naka-integrate na rin naman yan sa implementation.

1950
02:13:15,450 --> 02:13:20,990
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Doon sa rules natin sa ORA-ORA at saka sa ROCS, nandun eh.

1951
02:13:20,990 --> 02:13:22,110
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nasa rules na natin.

1952
02:13:22,110 --> 02:13:26,430
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung dito sa sexual harassment, it's already integrated.

1953
02:13:26,590 --> 02:13:30,170
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: There's a 2025 version of both the RACCS and the ORAOHRA.

1954
02:13:31,030 --> 02:13:38,190
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, mahingi tayo ng detalye kung paano sinasagawa itong mga routine inspection for submission sa ating committee.

1955
02:13:38,550 --> 02:13:46,330
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At matiyak na may sapat na pondo yung ating mga inspectors para matiyak ang functional compliance na ating mga agencies.

1956
02:13:46,970 --> 02:13:51,250
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, nagkaroon po ba ng mga cases kung saan ang CSC ang nag-handle?

1957
02:13:52,110 --> 02:13:58,730
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Isang sexual harassment case, imbes na yung CODI ng agency o ng isang university o ng isang LGU.

1958
02:13:58,730 --> 02:14:09,530
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi, Madam Chair, sa ilalim din po ng rules ng CSC, kung hindi po mahahawakan ito, maimbestigahan ng CODI ng isang agency,

1959
02:14:09,890 --> 02:14:15,710
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: doon sa mga sinasabi ng mga maaring dahilan, ay CSC ang tutugon sa mga ito.

1960
02:14:16,190 --> 02:14:17,730
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, tama po yun.

1961
02:14:18,450 --> 02:14:21,730
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Under the rules, under certain circumstances, instead of the...

1962
02:14:22,110 --> 02:14:24,890
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Agencies CODI, pwede pong i-file sa CSC.

