CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: But the underlying consideration is that if a relative is appointed to a position that

2928
02:55:27,100 --> 02:55:28,460
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: requires merit and fitness,

2929
02:55:28,480 --> 02:55:33,860
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: the consideration is not actually merit and fitness but the relationship itself.

2930
02:55:34,840 --> 02:55:42,740
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And according to a number of jurisprudence, what cannot be done directly cannot be done indirectly.

2931
02:55:43,260 --> 02:55:52,780
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: If you cannot extend that favoritism to your relative, neither can you extend the same favoritism

2932
02:55:52,780 --> 02:55:58,460
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: to a person who stands in the same place as your relative.

2933
02:55:58,480 --> 02:56:03,200
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Now, the Civil Service Commission does not come from nothing.

2934
02:56:03,200 --> 02:56:10,400
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: In the previous years, the Supreme Court has also declared as violative of the rule against

2935
02:56:10,400 --> 02:56:13,340
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: nepotism the designation of a relative.

2936
02:56:13,560 --> 02:56:15,100
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Designation is not an appointment.

2937
02:56:15,720 --> 02:56:20,300
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And designation is not also covered by the definition of the law on nepotism.

2938
02:56:20,620 --> 02:56:25,500
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: But the Supreme Court, using the same principle that what you cannot do directly, you cannot

2939
02:56:25,500 --> 02:56:27,620
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: do indirectly, also declared.

2940
02:56:28,480 --> 02:56:33,280
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: In the case of Laurel v. CSE, that if you cannot do that by way of appointment, you

2941
02:56:33,280 --> 02:56:37,440
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: cannot also do that by way of designation because the same evil exists.

2942
02:56:37,440 --> 02:56:41,160
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, that's where the commission is coming from.

2943
02:56:41,160 --> 02:56:45,300
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: We do not want the same evil to exist.

2944
02:56:45,300 --> 02:56:51,760
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: We just use as our basis those previous pronouncements made by the Supreme Court.

2945
02:56:51,760 --> 02:56:54,000
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: What you cannot do directly, you cannot do indirectly.

2946
02:56:54,000 --> 02:56:54,840
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair.

2947
02:56:57,150 --> 02:57:02,230
