3041
03:03:17,390 --> 03:03:34,390
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And then second, moving forward, ano po yung mga pulisiya in place ng CSC para maiwasan na natin o mapigilan natin yung ganito katagal na backlog on disputes or cases, Madam Chairperson?

3042
03:03:34,850 --> 03:03:43,430
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I think that was my first problem when I got into the Civil Service Commission.

3043
03:03:44,070 --> 03:03:49,490
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi hindi ko matanggap na yung isang administrative case magtatagal ng mahigit ng dalawang taon.

3044
03:03:49,990 --> 03:03:54,010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya ang ginawa po namin, linaka po namin yung lahat ng inventory ng cases.

3045
03:03:54,730 --> 03:04:02,310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos lahat ng pumapasok ay hindi tatagal ng mahigit 6 months kung pwede hanggang, depende sa complexity of the case.

3046
03:04:02,810 --> 03:04:04,250
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then we also adopted.

3047
03:04:04,850 --> 03:04:10,330
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang mga regular na meron ng template na decisions, then we just study and then ilalapat na lang.

3048
03:04:10,770 --> 03:04:23,170
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang ginawa rin po namin para matataas ang case resolution at saka case disposition is, nagbabacktrack po kami, may target kami na number going backward every time we have our commission meetings.

3049
03:04:23,610 --> 03:04:32,070
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos nag-segregate na kami ng commission meetings, hindi halo-halo, ang policy at saka yung case adjudication.

3050
03:04:32,070 --> 03:04:34,070
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May dedicated na number.

3051
03:04:34,850 --> 03:04:39,310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang mga regular na session for all cases para mapabilis.

3052
03:04:39,470 --> 03:04:43,950
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos nag-establish kami ng mechanism para magkakaroon ng pre-commission meeting.

3053
03:04:44,110 --> 03:04:47,350
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Lahat ng abogado ng tatlong executive offices.

3054
03:04:48,110 --> 03:04:49,730
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mirequire ko po yung fact sheet.

3055
03:04:50,290 --> 03:04:53,010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Parang tayo po ay nasa law school.

3056
03:04:53,610 --> 03:04:56,870
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Para lahat po ng case file, meron ng fact sheet, i-recheck mo na lang.

3057
03:04:56,870 --> 03:05:03,490
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mas mapabilis yung pag-aaral dun sa decision na inire-recommend ng Office of Legal Affairs.

3058
03:05:03,730 --> 03:05:04,630
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: When we adopted.

3059
03:05:04,850 --> 03:05:10,310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos mechanism na pinaigsian yung review, pero mas matindi ang review sa Office of Legal Affairs.

3060
03:05:10,750 --> 03:05:15,310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then we go to the executive committee meetings through a series of pre-commission meetings

3061
03:05:15,310 --> 03:05:17,510
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para mas mabilis yung action ng commission.

3062
03:05:18,150 --> 03:05:20,250
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So those are the measures that we have done.

3063
03:05:20,710 --> 03:05:24,730
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: If you look at our record from end 2024 up to 2026,

3064
