CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yung dami po na na-dispose namin na cases compared to the previous years ay medyo malayo na po.

3065
03:05:31,390 --> 03:05:34,070
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang target namin is within the end of the year.

3066
03:05:34,070 --> 03:05:41,270
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung backlog namin sa mga kapapasok lang na mga kaso ay ma-reduce to at least 10% or 5%.

3067
