CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Maiiwan na lang pala 10% or 5%.

3068
03:05:43,970 --> 03:05:46,730
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung sa aging cases, kailangan naming hukayin.

3069
03:05:47,190 --> 03:05:52,930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero I would think, depending on the numbers, ay pwede nating hukayin.

3070
03:05:53,410 --> 03:05:55,610
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Medyo dumami-dami na yun.

3071
03:05:55,930 --> 03:06:00,590
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang naging problema rin po before, hindi problema actually, but that is how processes work.

3072
03:06:00,590 --> 03:06:03,690
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Parang kinopia kasi yung adjudication system.

3073
03:06:04,070 --> 03:06:09,750
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The judiciary na hindi inilalabas yung decision hanggang hindi prinopromulgate.

3074
03:06:10,170 --> 03:06:18,010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero ang sinasabi ko ngayon is ipagdugtungin natin yung pinag-usapan namin sa meetings namin is

3075
03:06:18,010 --> 03:06:23,810
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: basta in-approve ng commission at subject na lang sa editing, pwede na namin siyang ilabas.

3076
03:06:24,190 --> 03:06:27,390
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos pwede namin ilagay doon yung upon effectivity.

3077
03:06:27,950 --> 03:06:30,390
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It can be a number of choices.

3078
03:06:30,390 --> 03:06:31,930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Depende sa klase ng kaso.

3079
03:06:32,290 --> 03:06:34,050
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Effectivity upon approval of the commission.

3080
03:06:34,070 --> 03:06:39,530
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Or after 10 to 15 days of publication in the official gazette.

3081
03:06:40,170 --> 03:06:42,490
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So those are the remedial measures that we have done.

3082
03:06:42,930 --> 03:06:52,130
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hopefully, if the project of ASCOM Ariel, which is the CLAS, which is the Civil Service Legal and Administrative Services Electronic System,

3083
