Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Magandang bagay po na merong admission po na meron talagang problema pagdating po sa case disposition.

3092
03:07:29,450 --> 03:07:32,610
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi ito pong mga manggagawa ng Land Bank of the Philippines.

3093
03:07:33,090 --> 03:07:34,010
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ilang taon na sila.

3094
03:07:34,070 --> 03:07:34,550
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nag-antay.

3095
